  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Missile Fist — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level you have learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, all creatures take 8d8 necrotic damage and are knocked prone by giant <em>Missile Fists</em>. As an action, you can target any creature of your choice within your domain with a single <em>Missile Fist</em> without spending cursed energy.</p>",
